 "text": "Home - Country Partners Cooperative\nMain\nUtilities\nOur Story\nOverview\nLeadership\nAdmin Staff\nCommunity\nAgronomy\nPrecision\nSeed Programs\nAgronomy Staff\nAgronomy Locations\nGrain\nGrain Staff\nCash Bids\nFutures\nCommentary\nContracts\nPolicies\nWeather\nEnergy\nServices\nEnergy Staff\nRetail Locations\nFeed\nFeed Staff\nFeed Locations\nCareers\nLocations\nContact Us\nForms\nCountry Partners Connect\nCareers\nLocations\nContact Us\nForms\nCountry Partners Connect\nPrevious\nCountry Partners Connect\nPlease click the link below for more information and to sign up!\nClick Here\nPress Release\nPlease click the link below to view the press release.\nPress Release\nWelcome\nTogether We Can\nABOUT US\n2025 Annual Report\nPlease click the link below to view our Annual Report for 2025\nAnnual Report\nREWARDS FOR YOUR COMMITMENT\nExplore our employment benefits & job openings.\nCAREERS\nCountry Partners Connect\nPlease click the link below for more information and to sign up!\nClick Here\nPress Release\nPlease click the link below to view the press release.\nPress Release\nNext 1\n2\n3\n4\n5\nCAREERS\nCASH BIDS\nFUTURES\nWEATHER\nCOUNTRY PARTNERS COOP DEPARTMENTS\nAGRONOMY\nWe have a large team of experienced Agronomists and Applicators, along with the latest technology, equipment and quality products to handle your agronomy needs.\nAGRONOMY DEPARTMENT\nGRAIN\nMaking deliveries efficient and accurate help maximize what you earn from a bushel. We offer multiple contract choices and competitive bids to help you create the perfect marketing plan.\nGRAIN DEPARTMENT\nENERGY\nCenex® products are proven to perform in the field and on the road in the tough conditions of rural America. We then back these products with exceptional, responsive service.\nENERGY DEPARTMENT\nFEED\nWe go the extra mile to ensure your satisfaction, offering ration balancing, total ration planning and delivery to the farm or field. We make a difference for your operation and your animals.\nFEED DEPARTMENT\nTired of simply looking for a job?\nFind a career with Country Partners Cooperative. We’re a progressive company in a growing industry, committed to providing the highest possible level of service to our customers\nCountry Partners is as dedicated to our employees as we are to our customers. We offer a variety of great career opportunities, rewarding work environments , competitive compensation and an excellent benefit package.\nCAREERS\nCommunity\nCommunity means more to us than just a place to hang an “Open for Business” sign. Country Partners is owned by members who call the communities we serve home. Our employees live here, and our profits stay here.\nWe’re also an active participant in the communities we serve. We’re proud that our employees serve as firefighters, first-responders, school board members and Sunday school teachers—and we encourage them to be involved.\nABOUT US\nPO Box 80 • 120 8th Street\nGothenburg, NE 69138\n308-537-7141\nOur Story\nAgronomy\nEnergy\nFeed\nGrain\nCareers\nLocations\nContact Us\nForms\nCountry Partners Connect\nConnect with Country Partners\nPrivacy & Terms of Service\n|\nSite Map\n© 2026 Country Partners Cooperative - All rights reserved\nSearch for:\nMinimum 3 character allowed.",
